Package: recount.explorer
Title: Recount Explorer
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Samuel", "Bharti", , "samuelbharti.io@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4190-7058"))
Description: A Shiny app for browsing, visualizing and exporting uniformly
    processed human and mouse RNA-seq studies from the recount3 project.
    This is an application rather than a library; the DESCRIPTION exists so
    that renv and CI can resolve dependencies, including the Bioconductor
    ones.
